                "metadata": {
                    "note": "Marketplace",
                    "category": "music",
                    "author": "Stephanie Leavell",
                    "description": "Celebrate the magic of every season with this collection of joyful, kid-approved music by board-certified music therapist Stephanie Leavell. Seasonal Songs features three original songs for each season—spring, summer, fall, and winter—including favorites like Blowing in the Wind, Five Perfect Pumpkins, and Busy Like a Bee.  Thoughtfully crafted to support children’s development and keep little ones engaged, Stephanie’s music is fun and imaginative without being overstimulating—making it a favorite for both kids and parents alike.",
